{"strings": [
  {"text":"David and Rosalind","translation":"데이비드와 로절린드","where":"worlds/chrysalids/scenes/david-and-rosalind/scene.json title"},
  {"text":"In front of everyone we were strangers.","translation":"모두의 앞에서 우리는 남남이었다.","where":"worlds/chrysalids/scenes/david-and-rosalind/scene.json caption"},
  {"text":"We did not look at each other.","translation":"우리는 서로를 바라보지 않았다.","where":"worlds/chrysalids/scenes/david-and-rosalind/scene.json captions[0] text"},
  {"text":"Alone — only in our thoughts — we were together.","translation":"단둘일 때 — 생각 속에서만 — 우리는 함께였다.","where":"worlds/chrysalids/scenes/david-and-rosalind/scene.json captions[1] text"}
]}
